<title>USA: Globalstar to sell $250 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>Globalstar to sell $250 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Globalstar LP said Thursday it planned to sell $250 million worth of units of senior notes due 2004 and warrants to buy common stock in Globalstar Telecommunications Ltd in a private offering.  </p>
<p>Globalstar said it would use the proceeds from the sale to develop, build and deploy its satellite-based digital telecommunications system.</p>
